MOSS-VL-Realtime adapter notices

The model checkpoint and its remote-code implementation are copyright OpenMOSS
contributors and licensed under Apache-2.0. The adapter calls the checkpoint's
native create_realtime_session API; it does not reimplement model inference.

Primary sources:
- https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-VL-Realtime/tree/06b067617677661194cf837970fe3a10f1a0e56d
- https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-VL/tree/560f8872c362b47a52ddf20ff6a1f9c8ac10b706/realtime_inference

The upstream deployment currently pins PyTorch 2.8 CUDA 12.8. This Vonk source
context is a thin, unaccepted CUDA 13 ARM64 adaptation for DGX Spark. It must
pass an ARM64 container build and a physical Spark canary before acceptance.
